<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman raises Credito.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman raises Credito.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Credito Italiano was raised to the &quot;priority list&quot; from &quot;market outperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 17 1542 4367</p>
</text>
